n supply is left floating, which can cause RTC/backup-register problems and undefined behaviour. This may be an original reference-design choice rather than a tampering.\", \"confidence\": 0.2}], \"summary\": \"The schematic is largely consistent with the spec: the NFC and display I2C pull-ups, the touch circuit and the SWD header all match. The most likely deviation is the SSD1306 BS0/BS1 strapping, which appears to be 0,0,1 rather than the specified I2C-mode 0,1,0. A floating VBAT pin is a lower-confidence secondary concern.\"}",
